// Type DAG + interning (Phase 1). Authority: design_documents/Phase1_TODOs/type_dag_interning_phase0_kinds.md
// Logical TypeKey = { kind, a, b, c }; stored in OrderedMap via decimal encoding "k,a,b,c".
// Seed-legal: inline records + List. Checker still uses strings; this module is unused by checker until Phase 2.
// Split on 2026-11-02 from type_interner.silica for memory reasons (profile 20261102T050916Z_silica-6b.tsv).

